 "decision_text": "Per sign. HI = y in (0.4, 3] (52 bins; 13 coarse bins of width 0.2), LO = y in (0, 0.2]. A (amplitude): s_HI = <P,m>/<P,P> (weights 1/sigma^2, jackknife over fields): |s_HI - 1| <= 3 sigma and s_HI/sigma >= 10. B (shape): coarse chi2 of m - s_HI P with the jackknife covariance <= 32.91 (99.9% of chi2, 12 dof). C (comparators): coarse chi2(comparator) - chi2(P) >= 25 for every comparator. D (finite X at small y): s_LO / f_hold within 3 sigma of 1 (f = 1/(1+eps'), eps' from the Roberts secondary term) and (s_LO - 1) >= 3 sigma. PRIMARY CONFIRMED iff A, B, C for D < 0 and D for both signs pass; A-C for D > 0 are secondary (discovery: s_HI = 1.19 +- 0.07).",
